s://github.com/datagen24/victual/blob/master/.devtools/issue742/RESULTS.md), finding F3).\n\n## Observed (read at `d4960138`, not exercised)\n\n- `GenericEntityApiController` gates `shopping_lists` as follows:\n  - create (about lines 36-41) and edit (about lines 341-346) with `SHOPPINGLIST_ITEMS_ADD`\n  - delete (about lines 203-208) with `SHOPPINGLIST_ITEMS_DELETE`\n- The seeded Child role holds `SHOPPINGLIST_ITEMS_ADD` and not `SHOPPINGLIST_ITEMS_DELETE` (`db/pgsql/roles-seed.sql:21`).\n\n## Inferred\n\nThe generic `PUT /api/objects/shopping_lists/{id}` writes a list's name.\n\n## To decide\n\nShould list containers have their own right, or are the item rights intended? Either way, record the answer.\n","closed_by":{"login":"datagen24","id":20876965,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODc2OTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20876965?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24","html_url":"https://github.com/datagen24","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/datagen24/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/783/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datagen24/victual/issues/783/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"